:: Battle [nobr]
<div id="EnemyInfo">
    <<showEnemyInfo>>
</div>
<br>
<div id="BattleRound">
    <<include "Battle Round">>
</div>
<br>
<<link "下一轮">>
    <<checkBattleEnd>>
    <<replace "#EnemyInfo">>
        <<showEnemyInfo>>
    <</replace>>
    <<replace "#BattleRound">>
        <<include "Battle Round">>
    <</replace>>
<</link>>

:: Battle Round [nobr]

当前版本还没写战斗流程。请点击下列链接决定战斗结果：
<<link "胜利">>
    <<goto $BattleWin>>
<</link>>

<<link "失败">>
    <<goto BattleLose>>
<</link>>